# Shadow SQLite DB for live-share-worker's sqlx build-time query checking
# (regenerated by crates/live-share-worker/build.rs from
# live-share-worker/migrations/*.sql on every build).
/crates/live-share-worker/shadow.sqlite

# `worker-build`'s wasm bundle output and wrangler's local dev state
# (Miniflare's local D1/KV emulation) for the Synced Share Rust worker --
# regenerated by `wrangler dev`/`wrangler deploy`, never committed. Note
# `.dev.vars` in that same directory IS committed (fake e2e-only values,
# see that file's own comment), so it is deliberately not matched here.
/crates/live-share-worker/build
/crates/live-share-worker/.wrangler

# Generated SVG output from `cargo run -- generate svg`
/*.svg
/fixtures/*.svg
